# yazhi-api — every Yazhi Dev product page (/chat, /foundry, …) talks to its
# gRPC services through a Connect / gRPC-JSON gateway:
#   POST {YAZHI_RPC_URL}/{package.Service}/{Method}   (Bearer YAZHI_API_KEY)
# The key is used server-side only and never reaches the browser.
# Unset → /foundry renders the audited sample (labelled "Sample") and /chat
# shows "Not connected" and sends nothing.
# See docs/BUBBLE-INTERFACE.md and src/lib/yazhi-api/rpc.ts.
YAZHI_RPC_URL=
YAZHI_API_KEY=
